ot available prior to 4.5)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable.mono - macOS Sequoia (15.6.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 Pro - Apple M1 Pro (8 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nMy game has an Options dialog that lets you resize the game window.\n\nIn an embedded window (i.e. running from Editor), this feature no longer works, and gives visual artifacts (probably capturing each tween).\n\n<img width=\"2168\" height=\"1444\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ca00277-ca05-4805-b8fa-542081dbf5ca\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start the game with a 1920 * 1080 window\n2. Execute code to resize it smaller (1280 * 720)\n\nIf I run from VS Code, the window is not embedded and resizes as expected.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```\nfunc resizeTo(width: int, height: int):\n\tvar newSize = Vector2i(width, height)\n\tvar w = get_window()\n\tvar tween = create_tween()\n\ttween.tween_property(w, \"size\", newSize, 0.2)\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url"